Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:53:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Added: Draw the extra keys as keycaps with icons and names

A new keycaps extra keys style, which is now the default, draws each key
as a rounded keycap. Keys with an icon have their name in small text
below it, like Home, PgUp, Copy and Enter, and Esc, Ctrl and Alt are
short names. An active Ctrl or Alt is filled. Text set as the display of
a key in the properties is kept. extra-keys-style = default brings back
the previous look.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GLNsTPnn2xKUQ4uFcevT6G
